englishSenses.definition:
n. A curved fold or process of the dura mater or the peritoneum;
   esp., one of the partitionlike folds of the dura mater which extend
   into the great fissures of the brain.

v. i. To grope; to feel with the hands.
v. i. To lie prostrate on the belly; to sprawl on the ground;
   to grovel.

n. The burden of a song; the chorus; the refrain.
n. Accompanying strain; subordinate and underlying meaning;
   accompaniment; undertone.
